	(text "SHEET 08 - THERMAL / FANS (PLAN.md sec.6)\nTwo populated 4-wire 5V PWM fan channels + optional third (FAN3 parts DNP).\nPWM: 2N7002 open-drain per Intel 4-wire fan spec (control input is pulled up INSIDE the fan;\nR8x3 is a board-side backup pull-up) - note the drive is INVERTING, handle in RP2040 firmware.\nTACH: open-collector from fan, pulled to 3V3_AON, 1k series into RP2040 counters.\nJ804: optional remote TMP1075 board in the battery compartment on I2C_AON (strap addr 0x49).\nFirmware: CPU-temp-driven policy w/ hysteresis (PLAN.md table), fail-safe 100% if boompid heartbeat lost."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 30 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "90bf93d9-093d-5ce7-9993-0dea8394eedb")
	)
